---
title: "Who owns each relation-equals gesture?"
accTitle: "Ownership of relation equals gestures"
accDescr: "bob capture-rewrite owns draft transforms; Mac Capture owns the fast-escape arm, picker keys, and the label-card toggle."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 12
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph BOB["bob-cli capture-rewrite"]
    direction TB
    A1["`**Space then =**<br/>becomes ~ when Links To would open`"]
    A2["`**Glued = or ~**<br/>toggles ~note:id and ~~note:id`"]
    A3["`**Bare ~=**<br/>becomes ~~; ~~= becomes ~`"]
    A4["`**x=2-**<br/>past-segment ~ stays on dash`"]
  end
  subgraph MAC["Bob Mac Capture"]
    direction TB
    B1["`**Fast == arm**<br/>restores literal = before the picker`"]
    B2["`**Picker ~ or =**<br/>flips in place, keeps the filter`"]
    B3["`**Label-card ~ or =**<br/>flips the token, keeps the query`"]
    B4["`**Escape on armed =**<br/>restores = and closes Links To`"]
  end
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  class A1,A2,A3,A4 focus
  class B1,B2,B3,B4 outcome
  style BOB fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style MAC fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
